    {
      "text": "Forest plot of sensitivity and specificity with 95% confidence intervals for 3 studies in children: detection of rifampicin resistance. Sensitivity is not estimable in two studies and 1.00 [0.16, 1.00] in Zar 2018-2023; specificity is 1.00 in all three.",
